use firn/tags

zen-browser is a Module
zen-browser can opt into browsers
zen-browser needs flake input "zen-browser" from "github:0xc000022070/zen-browser-flake"

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  option myConfig.modules.zen-browser.enable: enable "Enable Zen Browser"
  option myConfig.modules.zen-browser.default: Bool
    default: false
    description: "Set Zen Browser as the default browser via MIME types"
  imports: [./zen-browser.nix]
